        "answer": {
          "short": "$5.7\\text{ m}$",
          "worked": "In right-angled triangle $AOH$,\n$$\\begin{align*}\\sin35^\\circ&=\\frac{OH}{10}\\\\OH&=10\\sin35^\\circ\\\\OH&\\approx5.7\\text{ m}.\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
